# ============================================================================
# .gitignore — repository root
# videoeditor.agency · github.com/submangomedia/videoeditor-agency-v2
#
# Written by T4, 2026-09-05. The root is not in any thread's Owns column in
# THREAD-PLAN.md §4, so this file has no owner. It was written because the
# first commit was about to happen without it. Whoever claims the root should
# take it over.
# ============================================================================
#
# WHY THIS FILE EXISTS, AND WHY IT MATTERS MORE HERE THAN USUAL
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# site/.gitignore already exists and lists the right patterns — but a
# .gitignore only governs its own folder and below. It does NOT cover
# 01-Research-Import/, 02-Decisions/, 03-Build-Ready/, 04-Assets/ or the root.
#
# This project folder lives inside I:\My Drive\. Google Drive Desktop drops
# temporary folders and shortcut stubs into synced directories as a matter of
# course. Under R01 this repository is PUBLIC, and a file committed to a public
# repo is not removed by deleting it later — it stays in the history, in forks,
# and in the GitHub Archive.
#
# So the cost of missing a pattern here is permanent, and the cost of having
# this file is nothing.
# ============================================================================


# --- Google Drive Desktop artefacts -----------------------------------------
# This folder syncs. These appear on their own and must never be committed.
.tmp.drivedownload/
.tmp.driveupload/
*.gdoc
*.gsheet
*.gslides
*.gform
*.gdraw
*.gjam
*.gmap
*.gsite
*.glink
*.gtable


# --- Operating system and editor --------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
ehthumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.vscode/
.idea/


# --- Office and OS lock files -----------------------------------------------
# Left behind when a .docx or .xlsx is open. They are not documents.
~$*
.~lock.*#


# --- Nothing here should ever appear ----------------------------------------
# If any of these turns up, a build step has been introduced and the platform
# ruling in instructions.md §3 has been broken. Cloudflare's build command is
# EMPTY and must stay empty.
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.cache/
package-lock.json


# ============================================================================
# ⚠️ WHAT IS DELIBERATELY *NOT* IGNORED
#
# The research folders are committed in full. That is R01 (public repo) plus
# R27 ("Commit everything as-is"), both ruled by Masud on 2026-09-03 against
# options that named the consequence. 01-Research-Import/, 02-Decisions/ —
# including RULINGS.md and Portfolio-Catalogue.md — 03-Build-Ready/, 04-Assets/,
# WORKLOG.md and DEPLOYMENT-RUNBOOK.md all become world-readable on the first
# push.
#
# Cloudflare serves only site/, because the Pages build output directory is
# `site`. That controls what is SERVED at the domain. It does nothing about
# what is VISIBLE in the repository. Those are two different things and
# instructions.md §7 conflates them — RULINGS.md R01 records that §7's claim is
# now void.
#
# This is recorded, not re-argued. R01 was ruled and no thread reopens it.
# ============================================================================
